{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 三期生 山口県出身🐡 21歳の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "谷口愛季(たにぐちあいり)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー 15th Single ーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single「Lonesome rabbit /"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "What's \"KAZOKU\"？」がリリースされました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんの方の手に届いていたら嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob0Fwktn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobTRLwHn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobCZXaE1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケ写のオフショット！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りのカメラで撮ってもらいました〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobIF8kdT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobG1hzIe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とーってもかわいい衣装！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobfa3F6u.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Lonesome rabbit でシンメの優！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobDqpAHY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちー"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が撮った写真ブログに載せてくれてたー！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うれし˙ᵕ˙"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobaFVXxP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobGOj2Hn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💄"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobZPfXwM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob4CtLcQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobVkkEvj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesのまねっこしてみた。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サインを書かせていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "上のポップも私のことがたくさん書いてあってとっても嬉しかったです♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single期間楽しんでいきましょう〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私のスマホの写真フォルダは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ブログ」とか「いんすた候補」とか「とーく」っていう風に写真を分けてることが多いんですけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ブログ載せる候補」の写真が"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんとなんと228枚もあったので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すこーーしだけ放出させてください！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "多分載せたことないはず、、、！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobq5pfjM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "去年の春"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobpdKDGQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobpVsrov.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob6PcvId.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobqmrr0q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobCf25JE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これも去年。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobbgV8Lg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobTwB6eH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobqoVqKe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12th Single"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobtI2kRC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはコンタクトを切らせてしまい、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カラコンを着けるしかなかったあいり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回のブログはこの辺にしておきます！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだあるので、よかったらみてください、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近お気に入りのカメラが壊れちゃったんだけど、お気に入りのカメラすぎて同じものを買い直したんだ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また撮れるっっ♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たのしみだ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またねん👋🏻👋🏻"}], "source": "official"}